# Terrace walls at eye level on the landscapes whose walls read blockiest, at
# noon and in the evening, for any change to how a stratum wall is drawn; with
# the frame cost over five seconds on the middens.
#   TOUR_FIXED_FPS=60 tools/tour.sh tours/lands_strata.tour --seed=7 --weather=clear:0 --view=shoulder --stats
coast calm
hour 12
place typical_the_middens
wait 3.0
shot middens-noon with land:the_middens
perf stats begin
wait 5.0
perf stats end middens-noon
hour 18.5
wait 1.5
shot middens-evening with land:the_middens
hour 12
place typical_the_crags
wait 3.0
shot crags-noon with land:the_crags
hour 18.5
wait 1.5
shot crags-evening with land:the_crags
hour 12
place typical_ruined_metropolis
wait 3.0
shot metropolis-noon with land:ruined_metropolis
hour 12
place typical_scrapwood
wait 3.0
shot scrapwood-noon with land:scrapwood
